(text "The UART programming fixture uses 3.3 V logic. Connect host TX to fixture RX and host RX to fixture TX." (at 16 127.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 0b96e483-0757-5302-b0f7-69c10dbfcd8c))
(text "Drive HOST_BOOT_N low, pulse HOST_EN low for at least 1 ms and release EN. Keep BOOT low 3 ms after EN rises." (at 16 132.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid b81f4cff-bc4f-5a66-8f87-8ddb2253cb06))
(text "Release BOOT and reset after flashing. USB-HS joint-download is also possible on the existing USB-C connector." (at 16 137.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid e0a4174c-fd28-5df2-9683-7c79b0396e66))
(text "GPIO60 is held high by R11 on SD_EXT_CS_N. Socket DAT3 is an input in SPI mode. Confirm hot reset with both cards installed." (at 16 142.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c7512c97-bf3f-57c2-b7e7-7637e4a8ab34))
